{"3473430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "All Our Broken Parts", "steam_appid": 3473430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow US!!</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discord: </strong>vHQVy7DVxs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BlueSky</strong>:TinBirdGame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X</strong>: TinBirdGame</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a story-driven cyborg doctor  game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humans have vanished.</strong> In this sprawling city of machines, you play as Ruth, a robot doctor exiled to a humble clinic following a medical mishap. Use your stethowire and screwdrivers. Diagnose, repair, and shape the fates of diverse robot patients, as well as your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/778986f42c366994e9dcc450da118e84.poster.avif?t=1785831763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/778986f42c366994e9dcc450da118e84.webm?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/778986f42c366994e9dcc450da118e84.mp4?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An art unit with built-in AI, plagued by corrupted colors in its visual sensors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bartender unit that brews spirits from &quot;tears&quot;, suddenly unable to taste &quot;flavor&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A delivery unit with an odd, outdated engine, and a sales unit trapped in a loop of endless jokes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disassemble, repair, diagnose, rewrite, and purge.</strong> Faced with increasingly harsh corporate directives, ambiguous dilemmas, and emotionally overloaded patients, what difference can one doctor make?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/8363bbe54acd304344e76a3770b088ea.poster.avif?t=1785831763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/8363bbe54acd304344e76a3770b088ea.webm?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/8363bbe54acd304344e76a3770b088ea.mp4?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/f734f2453cc7746c0bdc48c9eb2ea7b1.poster.avif?t=1785831763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/f734f2453cc7746c0bdc48c9eb2ea7b1.webm?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/f734f2453cc7746c0bdc48c9eb2ea7b1.mp4?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/908c0a3724c0eaf88c31bf890256a6f8.poster.avif?t=1785831763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/908c0a3724c0eaf88c31bf890256a6f8.webm?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/908c0a3724c0eaf88c31bf890256a6f8.mp4?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why can't robots stop dreaming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why were these defective memories made unerasable?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is there really a sea... out there?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game features 5 patients and is expected to offer 6–8 hours of playtime. Along this journey, an epidemic, dreams, efficiency audits... the eye of the era’s storm quietly passes overhead, and will ultimately turn this small clinic upside down. Before it all ends, Ruth will be granted a glimpse of humanity’s whereabouts, the origins of the robots, and every secret concerning the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/e656aaddc4577d2d37433e644261e7ff.poster.avif?t=1785831763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/e656aaddc4577d2d37433e644261e7ff.webm?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/e656aaddc4577d2d37433e644261e7ff.mp4?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/0e02f026f122772deb93b64a1f85f7dc.poster.avif?t=1785831763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/0e02f026f122772deb93b64a1f85f7dc.webm?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/0e02f026f122772deb93b64a1f85f7dc.mp4?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>Tin Bird Studio</strong>, a handful of wanderers just like you, carving out a living in the shadow of the city. We hope that within <i><strong>All Our Broken Parts</strong></i>, you will hear their voices, and perhaps hear a bit of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/24489c6b131e63ff1c2e60f344564384.webp?t=1785831763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/24489c6b131e63ff1c2e60f344564384.poster.avif?t=1785831763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a story-driven cyborg doctor  game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humans have vanished.</strong> In this sprawling city of machines, you play as Ruth, a robot doctor exiled to a humble clinic following a medical mishap. Use your stethowire and screwdrivers. Diagnose, repair, and shape the fates of diverse robot patients, as well as your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/778986f42c366994e9dcc450da118e84.poster.avif?t=1785831763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/778986f42c366994e9dcc450da118e84.webm?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473430/extras/778986f42c366994e9dcc450da118e84.mp4?t=1785831763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An art unit with built-in AI,